<title>USA: South Portland, Maine, TIC recalculated.</title>
<headline>South Portland, Maine, TIC recalculated.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc, financial advisor for South Portland, Maine, said it recalculated Prudential Securities, Inc's true interest cost for the City's $1.515 million bond issue. Prudential's winning TIC is 4.5663 percent, not the 4.5646 percent originally calculated.</p>
